## Axioms (from `axioms.txt`)

All 18 declarations depend only on `[propext]`, `[propext, Quot.sound]` or
`[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`; none on `sorryAx`.  A source scan of
`CapTrace.lean` for `sorry` / `native_decide` / `admit` finds no occurrence.

